<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAfrica JSE turnover sets new 1.506 bln rand high.</title>
<headline>SAfrica JSE turnover sets new 1.506 bln rand high.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Johannesburg Stock Exchange (JSE) saw a record day of turnover with 1.506 bilion rands worth of trade passing through the market, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>The record beats the previous high of 1.447 billion rand set on February 13.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
